#          C program PurpleAirSubset which streams the data back on STDOUT.
#
#          Data comes from:
#          https://api.purpleair.com
#
#          Example:
#
#          curl -k --silent --retry 0 'https://ofmpub.epa.gov/rsig/rsigserver?\
#                    SERVICE=wcs&\
#                    VERSION=1.0.0&\
#                    REQUEST=GetCoverage&\
#                    COVERAGE=purpleair.pm25_corrected&\
#                    TIME=2025-07-01T00:00:00Z/2025-07-02T23:59:59Z&\
#                    BBOX=-75,40,-73,41&\
#                    FORMAT=ascii'
#
# HISTORY: 2020-12-24 plessel.todd@epa.gov
#
# STATUS:  unreviewed tested
##############################################################################

